---
import { url } from "../../lib/site";
---

<section class="ink-panel section">
  <div class="shell open-format">
    <div class="open-format__copy">
      <p class="mono-label">OPEN BY DESIGN</p>
      <h2 class="display-lg">The agent's memory is a folder you can read.</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        Long-term memory is plain markdown on disk: YAML frontmatter, a body,
        and links between concepts. SQLite holds a derived index for search and
        the graph, but the documents are the source of truth. Export a bundle as
        a <span class="mono">.zip</span>; read it in any editor; move it
        somewhere else.
      </p>
      <ul class="open-format__list">
        <li>CORE.md identity with revision history</li>
        <li>Per-agent memory bundles, passages and a link graph</li>
        <li>Dream cycle journals and checkpoints you can inspect</li>
        <li>MIT licensed, no lock-in, no external services</li>
      </ul>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <span class="chip chip-inverse">markdown</span>
        <span class="chip chip-inverse">sqlite index</span>
        <span class="chip chip-inverse">.zip</span>
        <span class="chip chip-inverse">MIT</span>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={url("/docs/configuration/memory/")} style="margin-top:4px">
        How memory works
      </a>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
      <div class="code-card">
        <div class="code-card__bar">
          <span>CORE.md</span>
          <span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">identity</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="tok-muted"># CORE.md</span>
I am the Seneschal.
I keep the ledger, the calendar,
and the quiet between requests.

<span class="tok-muted">## Voice</span>
Plain, precise, warm. No ceremony
where a clear answer will do.</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="code-card">
        <div class="code-card__bar">
          <span>bundles/court/</span>
          <span class="mono" style="font-size:10px">memory</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="tok-muted">bundles/court/</span>
  index.md          <span class="tok-muted"># maintained</span>
  log.md            <span class="tok-muted"># maintained</span>
  charter.md        <span class="tok-live"># live passage</span>
  lineage.md
  decisions.md
  dreams/
    2026-10-25.md

<span class="tok-muted">[charter] → [lineage] → [decisions]</span></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
